# A Little Knowledge completed and both its spells known (GMs; so only its 15, an Event, is left), Downward Helix
# accepted and On Sabbatical accepted at Prog 2 (GMs; missions as A Little Knowledge's flows), whose 20
# is a Progress reply. The two tie, so Erlene's replies alternate: each of Downward Helix's Progress replies (Prog 0:
# 24, Prog 1: 25, Prog 2: 26, Prog 4: 27) shows up beside 20 when an Event would lose to it every time. Both quests are
# set again (GMs) before each trigger, as the finishes advance or complete them.
